---
// Instructor - ballaholic style: card layout with photo placeholder
---

<section class="instructor section" id="instructor">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="instructor__inner">
      <div class="instructor__media fade-up">
        <div class="instructor__photo-card card">
          <div class="instructor__photo">
            <span class="instructor__photo-text">PHOTO</span>
          </div>
          <div class="instructor__photo-badge tag tag--filled">ASIA CHAMPION</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="instructor__info fade-up" style="color: #FFF;">
        <span class="section-label">Instructor</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">インストラクター</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          アジアチャンピオンが直接指導。最高の環境で学べます。
        </p>

        <div class="instructor__profile card" style="margin-top: 32px;">
          <div class="instructor__name-row">
            <h3 class="instructor__name">代表インストラクター</h3>
            <span class="tag">ASIA CHAMPION</span>
          </div>
          <p class="instructor__bio">
            ブラジリアン柔術アジアチャンピオンの実績を持つインストラクターが、
            初心者から上級者まで丁寧に指導いたします。
            長年のテクニックから実践的なポイントをお伝えする、
            それぞれのレベルに合わせた柔かな指導を心がけています。
          </p>
          <div class="instructor__socials">
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/tshr_jiujitsu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="instructor__social">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5" /><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1.5" /></svg>
              Instagram
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/304416070927536" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="instructor__social">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 00-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 011-1h3z" /></svg>
              Facebook
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .instructor {
    padding: 120px 0;
    background: #1A1A1A;
    color: #FFF;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Huge dark background text for extra street vibe */
  .instructor::before {
    content: "INSTRUCTOR";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -10%;
    right: -5%;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(12rem, 30vw, 28rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .instructor__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .instructor__photo-card {
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    background: #2A2A2A;
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .instructor__photo-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
  }

  .instructor__photo {
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #333, #111);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 24px;
    filter: grayscale(100%);
    transition: filter 0.6s ease;
  }

  .instructor__photo-card:hover .instructor__photo {
    filter: grayscale(0%);
  }

  .instructor__photo-text {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .instructor__photo-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 16px;
    left: 16px;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-radius: 60px;
    background: #FF5E1A;
    color: #fff;
    border: 1.5px solid #FF5E1A;
  }

  .instructor__profile {
    padding: 32px;
    background: #2A2A2A;
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .instructor__name-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .instructor__name {
    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #FFF;
  }

  .instructor__bio {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #BBB;
    line-height: 2;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .instructor__socials {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .instructor__social {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1A1A1A;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }

  .instructor__social:hover {
    color: #FF5E1A;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .instructor__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .instructor { padding: 80px 0; }
  }
</style>
